Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Workflow|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Configure Folder Workflow
Priority: 4
	Given ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Documents and Media|
	When Workflow configure Workflow Via Folder Info
		|workflowDefinition|Single Approver (Version 1)|
	And DMFolder add CP
		|dmFolderDescription|DM Folder Description|
		|dmFolderName|DM Folder Name|
	And DMFolder configure Workflow CP
		|dmFolderName|DM Folder Name|
		|workflowDefinition|Single Approver (Version 1)|
		|workflowRestriction|Default Workflow|
	And DMFolder configure Workflow CP
		|dmFolderName|DM Folder Name|
		|workflowRestriction|Parent Folder|
	And DMFolder configure Workflow CP
		|dmDocumentTypeName|Google Docs|
		|dmFolderName|DM Folder Name|
		|workflowDefinition|Single Approver (Version 1)|
		|workflowRestriction|Specific Restrictions|
	Then DMFolder configure Workflow CP
		|dmFolderName|DM Folder Name|
		|workflowDefinition|No Workflow|
		|workflowRestriction|Default Workflow|
